{"user": "any quick tips for these endgame puzzles so i don't lose next time?", "user_ts": "2026-08-11T23:23:08.511976+00:00", "assistant": "Quick endgame tips:\n\n- **Count, don\u2019t guess.** If only a few empties remain, try to visualize the forced sequence and final score.\n- **Corners are permanent.** Taking a corner is huge; avoid moves that give White a corner.\n- **Be careful next to corners** \u2014 especially X-squares/edge squares near empty corners.\n- **Mobility matters:** a quiet move that leaves White with **no good moves** beats a big flip.\n- **Don\u2019t chase flips.** Big immediate flips can just become White\u2019s discs later.\n- **Check passes:** if White has no legal move, they must pass and you play again.\n- **Prefer forced wins:** choose moves where White\u2019s replies are limited and predictable.\n\nHere the board is full, so no move remains \u2014 just count the final discs.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-11T23:23:08.511976+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-11T23:23:13.511976+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Solution Request"], "consensus": ["Solution Request"], "votes": {"Solution Request": 3}, "confidence": {"Solution Request": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Solution Request"], "sonnet": ["Solution Request"], "llama": ["Solution Request"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "votes": {"Board Report": 3, "General Principle": 3}, "confidence": {"Board Report": 1.0, "General Principle": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "sonnet": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "llama": ["Board Report", "General Principle"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Direct Instruction"]}}
